# Audio is served from per-surah GitHub Releases (see scripts/upload-audio.sh
# and NEXT_PUBLIC_AUDIO_BASE_URL). 6,236 files / 2.5 GB does not belong in a
# git clone. Fetch it locally with: npm run fetch:data -- --surahs=1-114
#
# This pattern contains a non-trailing slash, so git anchors it to this
# .gitignore's own directory (the repo root) rather than matching at any
# depth — it must name the app's actual path since the web app now lives in
# apps/web, not the repo root.
apps/web/public/audio


